==Strategy==
This stage is about using Area Attackers to take out the Doge Darks fast enough to get damage off on H. Nah. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] is useful in this stage to take out the Doge Darks, and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can do heavy damage to H. Nah.

It is recommended to have as many A Attackers as possible, such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and others to suppress the Doge Darks. Crazed Sexy Legs Cat helps a good deal amount in the beginning as he clears out the peons which in turn gives you money. Equipping a [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]] will greatly help if you cannot spawn your meatshields fast enough ([[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cat]], etc.). Cat CPU will also be financiallly viable thanks to the infinite amount of Doge Darks that spawn and provide money.

